@chapter ZIL Frontend Language
@cindex ZIL frontend language

This chapter describes the ZIL (Zork Implementation Language) frontend language as
implemented in the EightBol compiler. ZIL provides a high-level language for creating
text adventure games, supporting objects, rooms, verbs, and natural language parsing.
The language is defined by its lexer (@file{zil-lexer.lisp}) and parser (@file{zil-parser.lisp}).

